details.returned_prompt:
{
  "high_level_description": "A photograph of two hikers pausing on a wet peat path across the green fells of northern England, the lead hiker in a charcoal jacket looking out over a valley of layered blue-green ridges under overcast drizzle, shot on Kodak Portra with shallow depth of field.",
  "compositional_deconstruction": {
    "background": "Late-morning northern English fell landscape under an overcast sky with cool-neutral daylight and soft diffused shadows. Distant rounded fell ridges layer in receding blue-green tones toward the horizon, with a thin band of low cloud threading between them. Faint suspended drizzle specks catch the open sky behind the far ridge. The palette is muted — mossy green, peat brown, slate blue, weathered charcoal. A fine Kodak Portra grain runs evenly across the frame.",
    "elements": [
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Small tarn glinting in the middle distance on the left side of the frame, catching pale sky as a narrow silver-grey sliver nestled among the lower slopes."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "A pair of red grouse picking their way along a grassy slope on the far hillside at mid-distance right, small reddish-brown specks against the mossy green, heads lowered to peck."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Wet peat path winding diagonally from the lower-right corner up toward the mid-ground center-left. Dark sodden brown earth with small puddles reflecting the pale sky along its length."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Companion hiker a few paces behind the lead hiker, in three-quarter view facing forward-left, head turned right toward her companion. Slate-blue insulated jacket zipped partway, grey technical trousers, leaning on a wooden walking pole planted in the path. Medium build, short dark hair damp from drizzle, gaze directed at the lead hiker."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Mid-thirties female hiker anchored slightly right of center in the mid-ground, body filling roughly 55% of the frame height as the focal subject. In three-quarter rear view facing away from camera toward the valley, weight settled on her back foot as she pauses. Charcoal insulated jacket zipped to mid-chest, sleeves pushed slightly back at the wrists, dark technical trousers, scuffed brown leather hiking boots laced high. Worn olive rucksack with a rolled sleeping mat strapped on top; her right hand rests on the strap. Shoulder-length brown hair tucked behind one ear, fair skin tone, head turned slightly to look out across the valley."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Out-of-focus tuft of wet bracken slicing into the lower-left foreground, soft green fronds with water droplets clinging along the edges, blurred into a loose mass."
      }
    ]
  }
}
